<template>
    <heading>Global page layout</heading>
    <keywords>
        <li>CSS</li>
        <li>layout</li>
        <li>navigation</li>
        <li>panes</li>
        <li>status bar</li>
    </keywords>
    <section data-lp5-kind="explanation">
        <p>
            The page is a column: the navigation bar is at the top, the
            three working panes fill the middle, and the status bar is at
            the bottom. The middle row may shrink below the viewport's
            height because each pane owns its own scrolling.
        </p>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 560 190"
             role="img" aria-labelledby="pageLayoutTitle pageLayoutDescription"
             style="display:block; width:min(100%, 560px); height:auto; margin:0.75rem auto; font:12px sans-serif">
            <title id="pageLayoutTitle">LP5 page layout</title>
            <desc id="pageLayoutDescription">A top navigation bar, three middle panes separated by draggable splitters, and a bottom status bar.</desc>
            <rect x="8" y="8" width="544" height="174" rx="5" fill="#fff" stroke="#526174" stroke-width="2"/>
            <rect x="18" y="18" width="524" height="28" rx="3" fill="#dce8f5" stroke="#7890aa"/>
            <text x="280" y="36" text-anchor="middle" fill="#17283a">#LP5-TopNav</text>

            <rect x="18" y="54" width="116" height="104" rx="3" fill="#edf2f7" stroke="#7890aa"/>
            <text x="76" y="100" text-anchor="middle" fill="#17283a">#LP5-Toc</text>

            <rect x="138" y="54" width="8" height="104" fill="#8293a6"/>
            <path d="M142 98v16 M139 102l3-4 3 4 M139 110l3 4 3-4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="142" y="151" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="#fff" transform="rotate(-90 142 151)">.LP5-PaneSplitter</text>

            <rect x="150" y="54" width="184" height="104" rx="3" fill="#f7f4e8" stroke="#b5a36e"/>
            <text x="242" y="100" text-anchor="middle" fill="#342d1c">#LP5-Source</text>

            <rect x="338" y="54" width="8" height="104" fill="#8293a6"/>
            <path d="M342 98v16 M339 102l3-4 3 4 M339 110l3 4 3-4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="342" y="151" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="#fff" transform="rotate(-90 342 151)">.LP5-PaneSplitter</text>

            <rect x="350" y="54" width="192" height="104" rx="3" fill="#e8f2eb" stroke="#7d9c84"/>
            <text x="446" y="100" text-anchor="middle" fill="#203b29">#LP5-Output</text>
            <text x="534" y="65" text-anchor="end" font-size="8" fill="#526174">#LP5-Main</text>

            <rect x="18" y="166" width="524" height="9" rx="2" fill="#dce8f5" stroke="#7890aa"/>
            <text x="280" y="173" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="#17283a">#LP5-Status</text>
        </svg>
    </section>
    <section data-lp5-kind="code">
        <name>Global CSS declarations</name>
        <code><![CDATA[
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

html,
body {
    height: 100%;
    margin: 0;
}

body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
}

#LP5-TopNav {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
}

#LP5-Main {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-height: 0;
    min-width: 0;
}

#LP5-Toc,
#LP5-Source,
#LP5-Output {
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 0;
    overflow: auto;
}

#LP5-Toc {
    flex: 0 0 25%;
}

#LP5-Source,
#LP5-Output {
    flex: 1 1 0;
}

.LP5-PaneSplitter {
    flex: 0 0 4px;
    cursor: col-resize;
}

#LP5-Status {
    flex: 0 0 1.5rem;
    min-height: 1.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
}
]]></code>
    </section>
</template>
